WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:08.860
This American carnage stops right here and
stops right now.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:13.480
Mothers and children trapped in poverty in
our inner cities.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:18.890
Rusted out factories scattered like tombstones
across the landscape of our nation.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:24.870
And the crime and the gangs and the drugs
that have stolen too many lives

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.120
and robbed our country.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:32.180
We must protect our borders from the ravages
of other countries

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:40.540
I will fight for you with every breath in
my body, and I will never ever let you down.

